  17: 
  18:     Rule
  19:     - Clear the canvas to the background, preserving the separator row.
  20:     - Translate the guide marker upward so its top row becomes row 0.
  21:     - Move the sprite, preserving its color and shape, so the sprite bbox bottom-right aligns to the translated guide's lower-left branch.
  22: 
